        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "V-stitch: (tr, ch 1, tr) in same ch-1 sp. Every row: ch 4 (counts as tr, ch 1), * v-stitch in ch-1 sp of v below; rep to end, tr in top of t-ch. The foundation chain needs a multiple of 2."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Foundation"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chain 61. Row 1: tr in 6th ch from hook, * ch 1, skip 1, (tr, ch 1, tr) in next ch; rep, ch 1, skip 1, tr in last ch. Turn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Body"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Every row: ch 4, * "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "v-stitch-l7"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "v-stitch"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " in next ch-1 sp; rep to end, tr in top of t-ch. Turn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work until piece is 175 cm long (approx. 120 rows) or yarn is nearly used."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
